@page
@model Scheduler.BusinessLogic.Presentation.Pages.IndexModel

<h1>Scheduler — Consistency Demo</h1>
<p class="hint">
    Each handler chooses its own consistency level internally (per
    <code>7_consistency/readme.md</code>). This UI passes only business fields — never a
    consistency level or token. Watch the console for <code>PRIMARY/REPLICA</code> routing lines.
</p>
<ul>
    <li><a asp-page="/CreateJob">UC 1.1 — Create a Job</a></li>
    <li><a asp-page="/ExecuteJob">UC 2.1 — Execute a Job</a></li>
</ul>

<h2>Granular handler demos</h2>
<p class="hint">Each page calls several granular handlers directly from the presentation
   layer and shows what each returns.</p>
<ul>
    <li><a asp-page="/JobDefinition">Create &amp; read a Job Definition</a> — CreateJobDefinition → GetJobDefinition → GetJobDetail</li>
    <li><a asp-page="/JobRun">Create &amp; read a Job Run</a> — CreateJobRun → GetJob → GetJobHistory</li>
    <li><a asp-page="/JobOutputs">Append &amp; read Job Outputs</a> — AppendJobOutput → GetJobOutputs</li>
</ul>
